### Extensao "REST Client" (VS Code) ou cliente HTTP do Rider / Visual Studio.
### Suba a API antes:  dotnet run --project src/Triangulos.Api --urls http://localhost:5000

@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/health

### Classificar (GET) - triangulo 3,4,5
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=3&b=4&c=5

### Classificar - experimente outras entradas!
GET {{host}}/api/triangulos/classificar?a=5&b=3&c=5

### Analisar (POST) - analise completa
POST {{host}}/api/triangulos/analisar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "a": 3, "b": 4, "c": 5 }

### Analisar - outro triangulo
POST {{host}}/api/triangulos/analisar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "a": 2, "b": 3, "c": 4 }
